{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"塞尔维亚","country_iso":"SRB","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:38:52.174610","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"SRB-HB-0004","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"塞尔维亚1.5吉瓦风光制氢项目","project_name_en":"Serbia 1.5GW Wind-Solar Hydrogen Production Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"国际新能源解决方案平台","content":"塞尔维亚能源部长Dubravka Dedovic Handanovic在11月10日的一份声明中表示，塞尔维亚政府计划与中国公司上海风领新能源有限公司和紫金矿业集团股份有限公司合作，开发一个容量至少为1.5吉瓦的太阳能和风能混合发电厂，目标是每年生产3万吨可再生氢。\nHandanovic表示，上海风领新能源有限公司有兴趣投资塞尔维亚的可再生能源和储能，特别是可再生氢生产。该计划投资约20亿欧元，用于开发和建设太阳能和风能混合发电厂的基础设施，氢气生产的储能和氢燃料能源生产技术。该发电厂预计将提供1.5吉瓦的能源生产能力，有可能扩大到2吉瓦。\n根据7月份宣布的能源计划，塞尔维亚的目标是到2030年将可再生能源在电力生产中的份额提高到45%，显著提高能源效率，并将温室气体排放量减少40%。电网运营商EMS的数据显示，目前塞尔维亚拥有近400兆瓦的风力发电和52兆瓦的太阳能发电装机容量；同时拥有4.4吉瓦的燃煤发电，煤炭和天然气机组占该国能源结构的75%。","content_sha256":"ebca18d6dd7c0430e95fa9ea8e82c364d47593dd9f5b4ad584036451e96b69f6","id":11032,"publish_date":"2023-11-15 14:55:02","title":"上海风领新能源有限公司和紫金矿业集团拟在塞尔维亚投资1.5GW风光制氢项目","title_sha256":"6993800571ec3fb7f562fb60dd57155d9ffc450fd6bc23c1cada46ba66b18a00","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/53024.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"SRB-HB-0004","capacity_details":"PV: 1.5GW, Wind: 1.5GW","capacity_mw":1500.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"1500","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:38:52.174978","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"SRB-HB-0004-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://cn.fuelcellchina.com/Industry_information_details/1370.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"pro